fixtures/capture52/ comes from the K2 IS capture Capture52 of LiberTEM's test
data (libertem-test-data), published here with its owner's agreement
(2026-11-12). It holds metadata only: the tag file Capture52_.gtg, unchanged,
and of each sector file Capture52_1.bin to Capture52_8.bin its first 40 bytes,
the header of its first block, unchanged. The pixel data is not included.

